        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.9,
          "end": 6.4,
          "en": "Now, what if we worked a lot on components and on the data in our application?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.4,
          "end": 12.91,
          "en": "In this module, we'll have a look at the tools and techniques Svelte gives us that help us with providing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.91,
          "end": 14.83,
          "en": "a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.83,
          "end": 22.78,
          "en": "And with that I mean animations and transitions, animating, changing data, animating new elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.78,
          "end": 25.48,
          "en": "or the removal of elements on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.48,
          "end": 29.95,
          "en": "Because when you add an animation or a transition, state changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 29.95,
          "end": 34.36,
          "en": "So changes in your data are easier to grasp for your users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.36,
          "end": 39.43,
          "en": "Sometimes it's an animation that helps us understand what exactly changed on a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.43,
          "end": 46.75,
          "en": "And Svelte actually comes with a rich set of built in helpers that help you to easily add animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 46.75,
          "end": 48.58,
          "en": "and transitions to your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.58,
